cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Shortcut Learning in Feature-Based Algorithm Selection: Experiment Code"
abstract: >-
  Experiment code for a study of shortcut learning in automated algorithm
  selection: a selector trained on landscape features that read the objective's
  magnitudes can rely on them even when the optimizers it chooses between are
  unchanged by a strictly increasing transformation of the objective.
